specific cost function

00:02:54.861 --> 00:02:57.350
or minimize a cost function.

00:02:57.351 --> 00:02:59.960
You're going to be fairly
disappointed in the kind

00:02:59.961 --> 00:03:02.040
of reinforcement learning
algorithm that I use.

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:03.885
It's essentially the simplest.

00:03:03.886 --> 00:03:07.750
You can think of the one where
you get an estimate of the value,

00:03:07.751 --> 00:03:10.420
gets to reward prediction error
and update your values.

00:03:10.421 --> 00:03:11.900
So, most of my reinforcement learning

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:14.375
algorithms are going to
be limited to that today.

00:03:14.376 --> 00:03:22.390
Sorry. In the Psychology Cognition
Cognitive Science field,

00:03:22.391 --> 00:03:25.910
we think of reinforcement
learning as a set of behaviors,

00:03:25.911 --> 00:03:31.595
and also a set of tasks that
we use to probe this behavior.

00:03:31.596 --> 00:03:34.520
That's everything that
we're essentially

00:03:34.521 --> 00:03:36.890
