00:05:15.351 --> 00:05:21.455
That's because we identified
a region of the brain,

00:05:21.456 --> 00:05:24.710
and a region that has neurons
that encode dopamine,

00:05:24.711 --> 00:05:27.545
that happened to encode something

00:05:27.546 --> 00:05:30.845
