of as a reward prediction error.

00:05:30.846 --> 00:05:34.550
Is this is something you guys
know or no? Okay. Great, perfect.

00:05:34.551 --> 00:05:38.375
So, what I'm plotting here are,

00:05:38.376 --> 00:05:41.630
each line is the firing
of a single neuron,

00:05:41.631 --> 00:05:43.520
and the top is aggregating

00:05:43.521 --> 00:05:46.450
this over multiple trial
