well-defined circuits

00:06:46.071 --> 00:06:50.615
in the brain that uses
dopamine neurons,

00:06:50.616 --> 00:06:52.255
that have this
reward prediction error,

00:06:52.256 --> 00:06:55.055
to modulate plasticity between

00:06:55.056 --> 00:06:57.980
those neurons that encode
something like a state,

00:06:57.981 --> 00:07:01.400
and those neurons that will help
you make a choice down stream,

00:07:01.401 --> 00:07:04.220
that seemed to
essentially be encoding

00:07:04.221 --> 00:07:08.075
this equation with the help of
dopamine and neurons. Yeah.

