haven't seen an image before.

00:43:15.611 --> 00:43:17.860
&gt;&gt; Yeah, that's
the baseline assumption.

00:43:17.861 --> 00:43:19.855
&gt;&gt; Do we know if people are doing,

00:43:19.856 --> 00:43:21.880
