00:44:13.050 --> 00:44:15.430
So it probably accounts for some of

00:44:15.431 --> 00:44:17.455
the variants by it probably does not

00:44:17.456 --> 00:44:22.195
modify the key finding of interests
which is that working memory,

00:44:22.196 --> 00:44:24.730
the load effects, the

00:44:24.731 --> 00:44:27.340
learning which is why that's
something we have to get

00:44:27.341 --> 00:44:29.380
