01:16:04.261 --> 01:16:06.015
and despite that we still find

01:16:06.016 --> 01:16:08.370
those really important dissociations.

01:16:08.371 --> 01:16:10.140
People studying model based

01:16:10.141 --> 01:16:11.730
reinforcement learning
and humans have said,

01:16:11.731 --> 01:16:14.895
well it is dependent on working
on it and it is true it is,

01:16:14.896 --> 01:16:17.190
but what this shows I think is

01:16:17.191 --> 01:16:18.930
that model based
reinforcement learning

01:16:18.931 --> 01:16:20.520
