they are not needed.

01:18:34.286 --> 01:18:39.520
It's a bit hard to explain without
having introduced the question.

01:18:39.521 --> 01:18:41.320
But, it's more than overfitting.

01:18:41.321 --> 01:18:45.080
It's creating more structure
than there is out there.

01:18:46.590 --> 01:18:52.405
Yeah, it would take
[inaudible] sorry. Yeah?

